{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buggy Racing Simulator is a high-adrenaline ride where you\u2019ll feel every drift, bump, and near miss as you race through dirt, storm, and chaos\u2014fighting to stay in control while the world blurs past you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933800/extras/761ffe67a106bd0c077b3c96a02faa94.poster.avif?t=1772546579\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933800/extras/761ffe67a106bd0c077b3c96a02faa94.webm?t=1772546579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933800/extras/761ffe67a106bd0c077b3c96a02faa94.mp4?t=1772546579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Buggy Racing Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buggy Racing Simulator features 2 intense tracks\u2014a bright daytime circuit and a stormy night race\u2014each with unique terrain and weather conditions. Race through mud, rain, and sharp turns that test your control and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933800/extras/dc59d67b0deb94daac057a846ffc8066.poster.avif?t=1772546579\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933800/extras/dc59d67b0deb94daac057a846ffc8066.webm?t=1772546579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933800/extras/dc59d67b0deb94daac057a846ffc8066.mp4?t=1772546579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><